<title>UK: Monument to acquire London Bond Broking.</title>
<headline>Monument to acquire London Bond Broking.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monument Derivatives Ltd is expected to acquire the research and bond broking business of The London Bond Broking Company, it said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The LBB has operated as a division of stockbroker Albert E Sharp since it was founded in July 1992.</p>
<p>Sharp chairman Simon Sharp said: &quot;The disposal of LBB will further enable us to focus on our core asset management business together with the growing equity related business of corporate finance and institutional research.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
